OL,3,GNEWSAAmerican soldier arrested by UK
OL,4,Apolice on suspicion of spying taken
OL,5,Ainto US military custody
OL,6,
OL,7,FA US Army officer arrested in the UK on
OL,8,Fsuspicion of spying for Russia earlier
OL,9,Fthis month has been taken into US
OL,10,Fmilitary custody, British
OL,11,Fcounter-terror police have said.
OL,13,FThe serviceman has been identified as
OL,14,FLt Col Brandon Carroll Tyner, BBC News
OL,15,Funderstands. The 41-year-old - who
OL,16,Fserved in the US Army since 2008 - was
OL,17,Farrested near Gloucester last week by
OL,18,FBritish counter-terror police.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
